  "question": {
    "text": "Let a curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be given by the solution of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math>.&nbsp;If it intersects <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;and the intersection point of the curve with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence, by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>, we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></msqrt><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></msqrt><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now, it meets&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mtext>axis</mtext></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, hence</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>It&nbsp;passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
}